  "SP10631-000": "&lt;div class=&quot;woocommerce-product-details__short-description&quot;&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Ascend family of spinal orthoses is designed to elevate traditional spinal care to a new level. Molded support panels and improved circumferential stability combined with superior breathability and universal sizing make the Ascend line of products the elevated choice for patients who want to build confidence during recovery.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;product_buttons&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;wc-store-catalog-pdf-download&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;",
  "SP10637-000": "&lt;div class=&quot;woocommerce-product-details__short-description&quot;&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Ascend family of spinal orthoses is designed to elevate traditional spinal care to a new level. Molded support panels and improved circumferential stability combined with superior breathability and universal sizing make the Ascend line of products the elevated choice for patients who want to build confidence during recovery.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;product_buttons&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;wc-store-catalog-pdf-download&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;",
  "SP20464-000": "&lt;div class=&quot;woocommerce-product-details__short-description&quot;&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Pinnacle family of spinal orthoses considers patient comfort in every detail. These braces offer superior support, clinically advantageous features such as incision openings and ergonomic handles, and they are enhanced with premium materials and finishes. Pinnacle is the peak of comfort for spinal recovery.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;product_buttons&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;wc-store-catalog-pdf-download&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;",
