  "SP20639-000": "&lt;div class=&quot;woocommerce-product-details__short-description&quot;&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Pinnacle family of spinal orthoses considers patient comfort in every detail. These braces offer superior support, clinically advantageous features such as incision openings and ergonomic handles, and they are enhanced with premium materials and finishes. Pinnacle is the peak of comfort for spinal recovery.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;product_buttons&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;wc-store-catalog-pdf-download&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;",
  "SP30172-0XX": "The Ascend family of cervical collars achieves a similar level of comfort and support as the Pinnacle line, in a multi-sized option. Patients benefit from highly breathable anti-microbial materials and uniquely designed structural support that builds confidence during recovery. Providers benefit from a wide range of sizing options making the Ascend line of products the elevated choice for patients who want to build confidence during recovery.",
  "SP30272-0XX": "The Ascend family of cervical collars achieves a similar level of comfort and support as the Pinnacle line, in a multi-sized option. Patients benefit from highly breathable anti-microbial materials and uniquely designed structural support that builds confidence during recovery. Providers benefit from a wide range of sizing options making the Ascend line of products the elevated choice for patients who want to build confidence during recovery.",
  "SP30456-000": "The Epic LP family of spinal orthoses blends a lightweight, ultra-low-profile fit with superior support from form-fitting panels. The premium feel and intuitive design make the Epic LP line the ultimate choice for patients and providers.",
  "SP30627-000": "The Epic LP family of spinal orthoses blends a lightweight, ultra-low-profile fit with superior support from form-fitting panels. The premium feel and intuitive design make the Epic LP line the ultimate choice for patients and providers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;",
  "SP30631-000": "The Epic LP family of spinal orthoses blends a lightweight, ultra-low-profile fit with superior support from form-fitting panels. The premium feel and intuitive design make the Epic LP line the ultimate choice for patients and providers.",
  "SP30637-000": "The Epic LP family of spinal orthoses blends a lightweight, ultra-low-profile fit with superior support from form-fitting panels. The premium feel and intuitive design make the Epic LP line the ultimate choice for patients and providers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;",
  "SP40172-000": "&lt;div class=&quot;woocommerce-product-details__short-description&quot;&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Pinnacle family of cervical collars considers patient comfort in every detail, starting with structure. These braces are designed to support the unique anatomy of each patient through features like over-molded elastomeric support panels, strategic structural design and an ergonomic chin height adjustment knob. The design is enhanced by premium, super-soft anti-microbial fabrics laminated to highly breathable foam that reduce irritation and discomfort sometimes caused by more economic materials. Additional collar configurations give patients and their providers many options for achieving the ideal level of support. Pinnacle is the peak of comfort for cervical spine recovery.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;product_buttons&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;wc-store-catalog-pdf-download&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;",
  "SP40174-000": "&lt;div class=&quot;woocommerce-product-details__short-description&quot;&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Pinnacle family of cervical collars considers patient comfort in every detail, starting with structure. These braces are designed to support the unique anatomy of each patient through features like over-molded elastomeric support panels, strategic structural design and an ergonomic chin height adjustment knob. The design is enhanced by premium, super-soft anti-microbial fabrics laminated to highly breathable foam that reduce irritation and discomfort sometimes caused by more economic materials. Additional collar configurations give patients and their providers many options for achieving the ideal level of support. Pinnacle is the peak of comfort for cervical spine recovery.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;product_buttons&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;wc-store-catalog-pdf-download&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;",
  "SP40180-000": "&lt;div class=&quot;woocommerce-product-details__short-description&quot;&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Pinnacle family of cervical collars considers patient comfort in every detail, starting with structure. These braces are designed to support the unique anatomy of each patient through features like over-molded elastomeric support panels, strategic structural design and an ergonomic chin height adjustment knob. The design is enhanced by premium, super-soft anti-microbial fabrics laminated to highly breathable foam that reduce irritation and discomfort sometimes caused by more economic materials. Additional collar configurations give patients and their providers many options for achieving the ideal level of support. Pinnacle is the peak of comfort for cervical spine recovery.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;product_buttons&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;wc-store-catalog-pdf-download&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;",
  "SP40200-XXX": "The Breg Pinnacle CTO and CTO4 braces were developed to provide control through the cervical and thoracic regions. These braces help reduce movement in all three planes of motion – flexion/extension, lateral bending, and axial rotation. The CTO &amp;amp; CTO4 are adjustable and provide multiple adjustment points to help ensure support at every step as well as patient comfort.",
  "SS8XX": "Soft Stuff gel wraps stay cold for 45-60 minutes. Times will vary depending upon size of the patient, the environment and temperature of the freezer.",
  "TA008YXX": "Clinically proven to provide pain relief.* This single-upright OA brace provides the greatest amount of OA correction on the market. The unique design of the hinge allows for 36° of brace angulation. This allows the brace to unload knee joints that have excessive tissue. It can be made to unload the medial or lateral compartment of the knee. *Komistek, Richard D. Ph.D., Director, Center for Musculoskeletal Research, Nadaud, Matthew C. MD; Dennis, Douglas, A. MD; Anderle, Matthew R.; Kubo, Matthew B. “In Vivo Three Dimensional Determination of OA Brace Effectiveness: A Multiple Brace Analysis.” American Academy of Orthopedic Surgeons, February 2005.",
  "TA408YXX": "&lt;span&gt;The Legacy Thruster is a small, lightweight single-upright brace with the hinge on the affected side of the knee. This design creates relief by pulling the straps to open the joint space versus pushing against the opposite side of the knee. This design addresses OA conditions only, not associated with ligament instability.&lt;/span&gt;",
